notes.content:
Hey everyone! Big Update Time!

- 2-Player Split Screen – Grab a friend and play side by side;
- Remote Play Together – Invite anyone on Steam with a controller to join you, no extra copies needed;

Thanks so much for your continued support, I couldn’t do it without you!

Hey hey! New update has arrived:

- Added global leaderboards;
- Improved In Game UI;

Thanks for the continuous support!

Hey everyone! A new update is here:

- No more repeating sentences;
- The final mood now emphasizes the story;
- Added prompts to skip cinematics;
- The game now pauses when losing focus to other applications;

Thanks for your support!

Hey everyone! Here are today’s changes:

- Changes on the main menu;
- Improvements on some challenges at around 220 meters and 350 meters;
- Reduced music and cinematic volume from 75% to 40%

Thanks for your support!

Hey everyone!

Here are some improvements on the game:

- Fixed a bug where you would see a debug message on the first cutscene;
- General improvements on challenges for a better experience;

Thanks!
